        "@value": "Mark Takeshi McGregor, flutes; Greg Newsome electronics  Delve into haunting electroacoustic soundscapes and wild neo-noir glitch with “superhuman” flute virtuoso  Mark Takeshi McGregor . Returning to New Brunswick with performances in Moncton and Saint John, McGregor presents a programme for flute"
