        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "This event is free of charge!  New York? San Francisco? London? Phil Kline’s audience participation piece comes to Saint John! Phil Kline’s Unsilent Night is a free outdoor participatory sound sculpture of many individual parts, recorded on cassettes, CDs and mp3s, which are played through a roving"
